      "retrieved": "2026-10-05",
      "fields": [
        "nsc_persisted"
      ],
      "notes": "Persistence(%): of the graduates who enrolled in college the first year after high school, the share who returned for a second year (freshman to sophomore), from National Student Clearinghouse records. One class older than the entrance figure, because the newest class's second year isn't in yet."
    },
